$bog_flow_hints $mol_page
	title @ \Hints
	body /
		<= Inline $mol_view sub /
			<= inline \inline
		<= Declared $mol_view sub /
			<= label
		<= Overridden $mol_view sub /
			<= computed \
		<= From_page $mol_view
			sub <= tools
		<= From_view $mol_view sub /
			<= minimal_height
	label \Label

$bog_flow_hints_child $bog_flow_hints
	foot /
		<= label
